{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261017/photo/bkn-20261017064410929-1017_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261017065234\"/><p>事發在上水欣翠花園一單位。</p><p>今日(17日)清晨6時許，上水吉祥街8號欣翠花園一單位男子報案，指其11歲兒子在屋內昏迷。救援人員到場證實事主已不治。警員經初步調查後，相信事件無可疑，案件列「屍體發現」，稍後召仵工到場將遺體舁送殮房，死因有待驗屍後確定。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-16T22:59:26.116532+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":133,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-16T22:44:10+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-16T23:37:38.917573+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-16T22:57:40.752045+00:00","content_hash":"74b34779a916dbb7877754f021c5e38aa1d533c90e560b5df2dae42462aacde1","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}